# Scripted input for compose_window_modal.kt's windows (KLIO_WIN_INPUT): each
# window gets these events, timed from its own first event poll. A click at
# (220, 60) is in the windows' clickable part and outside the dialog; one at
# (50, 50) is only in the dialog's. Then the windows' close buttons.
300ms press 220 60
350ms release 220 60
700ms press 50 50
750ms release 50 50
1100ms press 220 60
1150ms release 220 60
1500ms close
